# What We Do

##### DKA helps companies of all sizes to grow their business in the public sector.

## OUR SERVICES

<!-- IMAGE: https://dkawins.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/gsa-logo-1.jpg (alt: "GSA SCHEDULE SERVICES") -->

### GSA SCHEDULE SERVICES

DKA has extensive experience with the General Service Administration (GSA) Federal Supply Service (FSS) Multiple Award Schedule (MAS), better known as the GSA Schedule. We’ve helped hundreds of companies list their products and services.

<!-- IMAGE: https://dkawins.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/img.png (alt: "PROPOSAL MANAGEMENT AND DEVELOPMENT") -->

### PROPOSAL MANAGEMENT AND DEVELOPMENT

DKA has written hundreds of winning government proposals for clients, with billions of dollars in contract wins. From initial solicitation review to contract startup, DKA is with you for the entire process.

<!-- IMAGE: https://dkawins.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Seal_of_the_United_States_Department_of_the_Navy.svg.png (alt: "Government Contracting Vehicles") -->

### Government Contracting Vehicles

Many agencies choose to award contracts to a large pool of contractors in a particular industry or industry grouping. These contractors will then be able to bid on individual contracts and/or task orders.

### OUR PROCESS

### Developing a better path to government business

Our goal for each of our clients is to grow and improve their business in the government sector. Since 1995, our clients have trusted us to identify, pursue, win and maintain contracts at the federal and state level. Every company is different, so our team of knowledgeable experts is on hand to tailor the right blend of our proposal writing and business development services for each one.

<!-- IMAGE: http://dkawins.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/handshake-icon-29-min-1024x1024.png (alt: "GETTING TO KNOW YOUR BUSINESS") -->

### GETTING TO KNOW YOUR BUSINESS

Nobody knows your business better than you.  Understanding your government contracting goals is essential to develop a successful strategy, and understanding what makes your company uniquely qualified to provide government buyers with your products and services is critical for writing winning proposals.

<!-- IMAGE: http://dkawins.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/analysis-icon-14-min.png (alt: "IDENTIFYING AND PURSUING THE RIGHT CONTRACTS") -->

### IDENTIFYING AND PURSUING THE RIGHT CONTRACTS

Success in government contracting takes more than just finding bidding opportunities; it requires finding the right projects and pursuing them in the best way possible.  DKA tailors its services to create the ideal fit for your company, concentrating on those contracting vehicles and opportunities which makes sense and are likely to help you realize your public sector goals.

<!-- IMAGE: http://dkawins.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/target-icon-png-17.png (alt: "DEVELOPING THE WINNING PROPOSAL") -->

### DEVELOPING THE WINNING PROPOSAL

Whether it’s submitting a GSA Schedule application or responding to an RFP, our focus is always on one thing: obtaining your contract award.  With more than 350 wins with a combined value in excess of $1.7 Billion, DKA has the experience to increase your likelihood of success on every project.

Talk with a member of our team about how DKA can help your company grow in the public sector.

